                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): Section 5 of the Technical Assignment of the Supply Contract was violated - quality documents for the delivered goods were not provided. /Нарушен раздел 5 Технического задания Договора поставки - не предоставлены документы о качестве на поставленный товар.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments): The visual inspection of Ceramic toilet with oblique outlet revealed a discrepancy - in fact, the WCs with horizontal outlet instead of oblique outlet were delivered. /При визуальном осмотре керамических унитазов выявлено несоответствие - фактически поставлены унитазы с горизонтальным выпуском вместо косого выпуска.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
